    "testCaseOrigin": {
      "mechanism": "The bound is the same structural one the reference records rest on rather than a promise. No producer in this workspace has ever opened a test belonging to an acquired entry, so there is nothing here to transcribe from. What holds it is the closed lexicon: every word in every proposal file, test cases included, has to appear in checks/proposals-lexicon.txt, and that lexicon is required to share nothing with the identifiers the inventory knows. A transcribed test would arrive carrying words nobody added to the lexicon, and a lexicon edited to admit them would fail against the same identifier set.",
